{
  "name": "Telegram Crypto Price Alert",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            { "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 15 }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Every 15 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.coingecko.com/api/v3/simple/price?ids=bitcoin,ethereum,solana&vs_currencies=usd&include_24hr_change=true",
        "method": "GET",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Fetch Prices",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [500, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst data = items[0].json;\nconst thresholds = {\n  bitcoin: { low: 50000, high: 100000 },\n  ethereum: { low: 2000, high: 5000 },\n  solana: { low: 50, high: 200 }\n};\nconst results = [];\nfor (const [coin, prices] of Object.entries(data)) {\n  const price = prices.usd;\n  const change24h = prices.usd_24h_change || 0;\n  const threshold = thresholds[coin] || { low: 0, high: Infinity };\n  const crossedLow = price <= threshold.low;\n  const crossedHigh = price >= threshold.high;\n  const shouldAlert = crossedLow || crossedHigh || Math.abs(change24h) > 10;\n  results.push({\n    json: {\n      coin,\n      price,\n      change24h: change24h.toFixed(2),\n      crossedLow,\n      crossedHigh,\n      shouldAlert,\n      alertReason: crossedLow ? 'Below support' : crossedHigh ? 'Above resistance' : Math.abs(change24h) > 10 ? 'Large 24h move' : 'Normal',\n      timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n      date: new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]\n    }\n  });\n}\nreturn results;"
      },
      "name": "Parse & Check Thresholds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [750, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.shouldAlert}}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Should Alert?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1000, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "",
        "text": "=🚨 <b>Crypto Alert: {{$json.coin}}</b>\n\n💰 Price: ${{$json.price}}\n📈 24h Change: {{$json.change24h}}%\n⚠️ Reason: {{$json.alertReason}}\n🕐 {{$json.timestamp}}",
        "additionalFields": { "parse_mode": "HTML" }
      },
      "name": "Send Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1250, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": { "value": "" },
        "sheetName": { "value": "PriceHistory" },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Log Price History",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1250, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Telegram Crypto Price Alert\n\nEvery 15 min → CoinGecko API → check price thresholds → alert if crossed → log history.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Edit thresholds in Parse & Check Thresholds code node\n2. Add more coins to the CoinGecko API URL\n3. Set Telegram chat ID in Send Alert node\n4. Create Google Sheet: coin, price, change24h, shouldAlert, alertReason, timestamp, date",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 220
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 500]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 15 Minutes": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Fetch Prices", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch Prices": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Parse & Check Thresholds", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Parse & Check Thresholds": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Should Alert?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Should Alert?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Send Alert", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Log Price History", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Send Alert": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Log Price History", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  }
}